---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
    title="Workshops & Classes | Himaya Garden Tucson"
    description="Hands-on workshops at Himaya Garden. Learn from experts in a beautiful garden setting. Yoga, edible arts, creative classes, and more."
>
    <main>
        <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-cream pt-32 pb-20 md:pt-40 md:pb-28">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top,_rgba(132,147,118,0.18),_transparent_58%)]"></div>
            <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr]">
                    <div>
                        <p class="section-label fade-in">Workshops & classes</p>
                        <h1 class="fade-in delay-1 font-serif text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-light leading-none text-charcoal">
                            Learn, explore, and create in the garden.
                        </h1>
                        <p class="fade-in delay-2 mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone">
                            From yoga and wellness to edible arts, floral design, and creative pursuits, our workshops bring together expert instruction, beautiful surroundings, and a community of curious, creative people.
                        </p>
                        <div class="fade-in delay-3 mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
                            <a href="/events" class="btn-primary">View All Workshops</a>
                            <a href="/contact" class="btn-secondary">Inquire About Custom Classes</a>
                        </div>
                        <div class="fade-in delay-4 mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-8 text-sm text-charcoal">
                            <div>
                                <div class="font-serif text-3xl text-sage">Monthly</div>
                                <div class="mt-1 text-stone">Class schedule</div>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="font-serif text-3xl text-sage">Expert</div>
                                <div class="mt-1 text-stone">Facilitation</div>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="font-serif text-3xl text-sage">Community</div>
                                <div class="mt-1 text-stone">Learning</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="fade-in delay-2 overflow-hidden rounded-sm shadow-lg">
                        <img src="/media/img/hero-image.webp" alt="Workshop in the garden" class="h-full w-full object-cover" />
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-warm-white py-20 md:py-24">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <div class="text-center">
                    <p class="section-label fade-in">Workshop categories</p>
                    <h2 class="fade-in delay-1 font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light text-charcoal">
                        Something for every curious mind.
                    </h2>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
                    <article class="fade-in border border-sage/10 bg-cream p-7 rounded-sm">
                        <div class="mb-4 text-3xl">🧘</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Wellness & movement</h3>
                        <p class="mt-3 text-stone leading-relaxed">
                            Yoga, meditation, sound healing, and movement practices supported by the garden's natural restorative energy.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="fade-in delay-1 border border-sage/10 bg-cream p-7 rounded-sm">
                        <div class="mb-4 text-3xl">🎨</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Creative arts</h3>
                        <p class="mt-3 text-stone leading-relaxed">
                            Edible arts, floral design, painting, and hands-on creative experiences for makers of all levels.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="fade-in delay-2 border border-sage/10 bg-cream p-7 rounded-sm">
                        <div class="mb-4 text-3xl">🌿</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Garden & nature</h3>
                        <p class="mt-3 text-stone leading-relaxed">
                            Botanical learning, sustainable gardening, plant knowledge, and connection with the natural world.
                        </p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-cream py-24 md:py-32">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
                    <div>
                        <p class="section-label fade-in">Our workshop approach</p>
                        <h2 class="fade-in delay-1 font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light leading-tight text-charcoal">
                            Small groups, expert guidance, beautiful spaces.
                        </h2>
                        <div class="mt-6 space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone">
                            <p>
                                We believe learning is more meaningful when it happens in community, guided by experts who care, and set within spaces that inspire. Every workshop is designed to balance skill-building with joy and connection.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="grid gap-6">
                        <div class="fade-in border border-sage/10 bg-warm-white p-6 rounded-sm">
                            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sage">Small groups</p>
                            <h3 class="mt-3 font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Intimate learning</h3>
                            <p class="mt-3 text-stone leading-relaxed">Limited class sizes ensure hands-on guidance and individual attention from facilitators.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="fade-in delay-1 border border-sage/10 bg-warm-white p-6 rounded-sm">
                            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sage">Expert teachers</p>
                            <h3 class="mt-3 font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Knowledge & passion</h3>
                            <p class="mt-3 text-stone leading-relaxed">Our facilitators are experienced practitioners who love sharing their craft and knowledge.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="fade-in delay-2 border border-sage/10 bg-warm-white p-6 rounded-sm">
                            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sage">Beautiful venue</p>
                            <h3 class="mt-3 font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Inspiring setting</h3>
                            <p class="mt-3 text-stone leading-relaxed">The garden itself becomes part of the learning — creating calm, inspiration, and connection.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-warm-white py-20 md:py-24">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
                    <p class="section-label fade-in">Workshop types</p>
                    <h2 class="fade-in delay-1 font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light text-charcoal">
                        From drop-in classes to deep dives.
                    </h2>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
                    <div class="fade-in bg-cream border border-sage/10 p-6 rounded-sm">
                        <div class="text-2xl mb-3">⏰</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-lg text-charcoal">Single sessions</h3>
                        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone">One-time workshops — perfect for exploring new interests</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="fade-in delay-1 bg-cream border border-sage/10 p-6 rounded-sm">
                        <div class="text-2xl mb-3">🔄</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-lg text-charcoal">Series classes</h3>
                        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone">Multi-week programs for deepening skills and knowledge</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="fade-in delay-2 bg-cream border border-sage/10 p-6 rounded-sm">
                        <div class="text-2xl mb-3">🌙</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-lg text-charcoal">Seasonal specials</h3>
                        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone">Limited-edition workshops tied to seasons and themes</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="fade-in delay-3 bg-cream border border-sage/10 p-6 rounded-sm">
                        <div class="text-2xl mb-3">👥</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-lg text-charcoal">Private groups</h3>
                        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone">Custom workshops designed for your team or community</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-cream py-24 md:py-32">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] items-center">
                    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-sm">
                        <img src="/media/img/collage-3_4.webp" alt="Workshop in progress" class="h-full w-full object-cover" />
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <p class="section-label fade-in">What to expect</p>
                        <h2 class="fade-in delay-1 font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light leading-tight text-charcoal">
                            Thoughtful programming, attentive guidance, genuine connection.
                        </h2>
                        <p class="fade-in delay-2 mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone">
                            Each workshop begins with community building, moves into skill-focused instruction, and ends with space to absorb, celebrate, and connect with fellow learners.
                        </p>
                        <ul class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-stone">
                            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-sage">◈</span> All experience levels warmly welcomed</li>
                            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-sage">◈</span> Materials and refreshments included</li>
                            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-sage">◈</span> Flexible, low-pressure learning environment</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-warm-white py-20 md:py-24">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
                    <p class="section-label fade-in">Featured workshop</p>
                    <h2 class="fade-in delay-1 font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light text-charcoal">
                        The Edible Arts Lab (TEAL)
                    </h2>
                    <p class="fade-in delay-2 mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone">
                        Our signature workshop series where food, creativity, education, and gathering come together. Paint with buttercream, learn art history, and taste the art. Starting with Edible Monet, a hands-on experience inspired by Claude Monet and Impressionist art.
                    </p>
                    <div class="fade-in delay-3 mt-8">
                        <a href="/edible-arts-lab" class="btn-primary">Explore TEAL</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="relative overflow-hidden py-32 md:py-40 text-center text-white">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
                <img src="/media/img/AG1_4.jpg" alt="Workshop community" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            </div>
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-charcoal/50 z-[1]"></div>
            <div class="relative z-[2] max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <p class="section-label text-white/80 fade-in">Ready to join?</p>
                <h2 class="fade-in font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-light leading-tight mb-6">
                    Explore our workshop calendar.
                </h2>
                <p class="fade-in delay-1 text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed mb-8 text-white/80">
                    Browse upcoming classes, reserve your spot, or inquire about private group workshops.
                </p>
                <div class="fade-in delay-2 flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center">
                    <a href="/events" class="btn-primary">View Workshop Calendar</a>
                    <a href="/contact" class="btn-secondary border-white text-white hover:bg-white hover:text-charcoal">Request Custom Workshop</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
</BaseLayout>
